                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The government shutdown is going to affect communities nationwide. Healthcare and some Medicaid services experience interruptions. Many families risk losing access to essential health care, nutrition programs, and support services that they rely on every day.\n\nThese cuts put people last, not first. A bipartisan solution is the only way to protect families and communities and ensure Americans can access the services they need.\n\nSee more from @KGNSnews.\u2b07\ufe0f",
